# Cafe De Paris — Project Architecture

## Overview
A full-stack restaurant management ecosystem comprising 4 client interfaces, all consuming a shared REST API.

---

## Tech Stack

| Layer | Technology |
|---|---|
| Waiter App | Flutter (Android + iOS) |
| Manager Website | SvelteKit |
| Owner Website | SvelteKit (separate route/subdomain) |
| Kitchen Display | SvelteKit (fullscreen web) |
| API | Go (Fiber) + PostgreSQL (Neon) |
| Auth | Phone OTP (Waiter), Email+Password JWT (Manager/Owner) |
| Real-time | WebSockets (KDS order updates) |

